{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
    "name": "PsyConnect - Création en masse (Patients)",
    "description": "À utiliser avec le Collection Runner + le fichier psyconnect_patients_data.csv (même dossier).\n\nDans Postman : Collection Runner > sélectionner cette collection > Data file = psyconnect_patients_data.csv > Iterations = nombre de lignes du CSV (12) > Run.\n\nLe Runner exécute les 4 requêtes ci-dessous, dans l'ordre, pour chaque ligne du CSV (= chaque patient). Les variables authToken / authUserId / userProfileId sont capturées automatiquement d'une requête à l'autre via les scripts \"Tests\".\n\nPré-requis : le gateway doit tourner sur {{baseUrl}} (par défaut http://localhost:8080).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "authToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "authUserId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userProfileId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Inscription patient",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Inscription OK (200)', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"pseudo\": \"{{pseudo}}\",\n  \"firstName\": \"{{firstName}}\",\n  \"lastName\": \"{{lastName}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register/patient",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "register", "patient"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Connexion",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Connexion OK (200)', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "const data = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', data.token);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('authUserId', data.userId);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "login"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Création du profil utilisateur",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Profil utilisateur créé (201)', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "const data = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('userProfileId', data.id);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"authUserId\": {{authUserId}},\n  \"firstName\": \"{{firstName}}\",\n  \"lastName\": \"{{lastName}}\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{phoneNumber}}\",\n  \"gender\": \"{{gender}}\",\n  \"dateOfBirth\": \"{{dateOfBirth}}\",\n  \"address\": \"{{address}}\",\n  \"city\": \"{{city}}\",\n  \"country\": \"{{country}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["users"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Création du profil patient",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Profil patient créé (201)', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"userProfileId\": {{userProfileId}},\n  \"emergencyContactName\": \"{{emergencyContactName}}\",\n  \"emergencyContactPhone\": \"{{emergencyContactPhone}}\",\n  \"medicalHistory\": \"{{medicalHistory}}\",\n  \"preferredLanguage\": \"{{preferredLanguage}}\",\n  \"anonymousMode\": {{anonymousMode}}\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/patients",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["patients"]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
